      },
      "lineNbr": 67,
      "author": {
        "id": 1882526
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-04-14T14:40:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027ve tried using a [`once_cell::race::OnceRef\u003cT\u003e`](https://docs.rs/once_cell/latest/once_cell/race/struct.OnceRef.html) - which seems to be exactly what we want - and [`once_cell::race::OnceBox\u003cT\u003e`](https://docs.rs/once_cell/latest/once_cell/race/struct.OnceBox.html) and I\u0027m getting stuck between them requiring `T: Sized`:\n\n```\nerror[E0277]: the size for values of type `(dyn rand::Entropy + \u0027static)` cannot be known at compilation time\n  --\u003e packages/modules/Virtualization/pvmfw/src/rand.rs:69:17\n   |\n69 | static ENTROPY: OnceBox\u003cdyn Entropy\u003e \u003d OnceBox::new();\n   |                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ doesn\u0027t have a size known at compile-time\n   |\n   \u003d help: the trait `core::marker::Sized` is not implemented for `(dyn rand::Entropy + \u0027static)`\nnote: required by a bound in `once_cell::race::OnceBox`\n```\n\nand Rust\u0027s [object safety](https://doc.rust-lang.org/reference/items/traits.html#object-safety) rejecting `Self: Sized` for traits:\n\n```\nerror[E0038]: the trait `rand::Entropy` cannot be made into an object\n  --\u003e packages/modules/Virtualization/pvmfw/src/rand.rs:69:25\n   |\n69 | static ENTROPY: OnceBox\u003cdyn Entropy\u003e \u003d OnceBox::new();\n   |                         ^^^^^^^^^^^ `rand::Entropy` cannot be made into an object\n   |\nnote: for a trait to be \"object safe\" it needs to allow building a vtable to allow the call to be resolvable dynamically; for more information visit \u003chttps://doc.rust-lang.org/reference/items/traits.html#object-safety\u003e\n  --\u003e packages/modules/Virtualization/pvmfw/src/rand.rs:47:30\n   |\n47 | trait Entropy: Sync + Send + Sized {\n   |       -------                ^^^^^ ...because it requires `Self: Sized`\n   |       |\n   |       this trait cannot be made into an object...\n```\n\nIsn\u0027t it possible to use `OnceRef`/`OnceBox` with traits?",
      "parentUuid": "f7b4d93c_916e1bd8",
      "revId": "81186a2c527fd4c77e35aed298ac6e95290cb650",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
